(
K04 (2026-10-06): force_edge_node selects SIDES whose nodes are ALL in
the list (Professional 02-08-2026). Unit quad4, E = 1, nu = 0,
x fixed on the right edge (nodes 2 4), force_edge 1 0 restricted to
nodes 1 3: only the left side (1-3) is loaded, a uniaxial bar with
disx(1) = disx(3) = 1 (= Professional 02-08-2026).
GNU before K04 (node by node): 2 / 2 (the bottom side 1-2 and the top
side 3-4 were also loaded on their node 1 / node 3).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 0 2 -velx
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_dof 2 1 -vely
bounda_dof 3 2 -vely
bounda_time 0 0 0 1 0
force_edge 0 1 0
geometry_point 1 0 0 100
force_edge_geometry 0 -geometry_point 1
force_edge_node 0 1 3
control_timestep 0 1 1
target_item    1  -node_dof 1 -disx
target_value   1  1.0 1.e-8
target_item    2  -node_dof 3 -disx
target_value   2  1.0 1.e-8
end_data
